---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-ink/8 bg-mist/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent/25 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">CC Counseling</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Virtual therapy for individuals and couples across North Carolina.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/70">Contact</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Email:
          <a class="text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="mailto:hello@cccounselingnc.com"
            >hello@cccounselingnc.com</a
          ><br />
          Phone:
          <a class="text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="tel:+19194571981">(919) 457-1981</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/70">Service area</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Serving clients across North Carolina via telehealth.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/70">Quick links</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a class="text-muted underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent hover:underline" href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li>
            <a class="text-muted underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent hover:underline" href="/insurance-rates"
              >Insurance &amp; Rates</a
            >
          </li>
          <li><a class="text-muted underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent hover:underline" href="/faq-1">FAQ</a></li>
          <li>
            <a class="text-muted underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent hover:underline" href="/contact-get-started"
              >Get Started</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 space-y-4 border-t border-ink/10 pt-8 text-center text-xs text-muted sm:text-left">
      <p>&copy; {year} CC Counseling. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        This site is not intended for emergencies. If you are in crisis or need immediate support, call or text 988,
        call 911, or go to the nearest emergency room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
